title: Roadmaps
new-page: true
view-if: roadmap_card_timer = 0 and year > 2012 and player_roadmap != 0 and not broken_roadmap
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; roadmap_card_timer = 6
max-visits: 36
is-card: true
card-image: img/events/full_de_ruta_anc.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: erc_party cup_party jxsi_party jxcat_party
go-to: roadmaps_choices
role: card-party

@roadmaps_choices
new-page: true

= Roadmaps

While independence may be the ultimate objective, the spectrum of parties supporting it is very broad. Not only on the socio-economic left-right spectrum, but also in the ways to get there. It is in this latter one that we have a chance to influence their positions and align them with ours.

{! <div id="roadmaps" data-widget="roadmaps" style="height:15em"></div>!}

- @change_erc
- @change_cup
- @move_erc
- @move_ciu
- @move_jxsi
- @move_jxcat
- @move_cup
- @move_pdcat_split
- @move_fnc
- @return: No need to discuss anything at the moment.
- @easy_discard

@change_erc
title: Let's revisit our own Roadmap
subtitle: [? if roadmap_year = 0: We don't have any date goal for our roadmap, which is kind of expected of such a plan. We may want to set one up. ?]
view-if: player_party = "erc" and not erc_in_jxsi and not erc_in_jxcat
choose-if: not consultation_pending and not referendum_pending and not (congreso_decidir_countdown > 0 and player_roadmap < 2) and player_roadmap_change_trigger
unavailable-subtitle: [? if consultation_pending: We can't change our Roadmap with a consultation on independence being just around the corner. ?][? if referendum_pending: We can't change our Roadmap with a referendum on independence being just around the corner. ?][? if congreso_decidir_countdown > 0 and player_roadmap < 2: We can't change our Roadmap when we are waiting for the Congreso to vote on the right to decide. ?][? if not player_roadmap_change_trigger: We've changed our roadmap recently, we'll have to wait before we can do that again. ?]

We are currently defending a [+ player_roadmap : roadmap +] roadmap[?if not roadmap_year: .?] [? if roadmap_year: , to be achieved by [+ roadmap_year +]. ?]

- @erc_relax_roadmap
- @erc_strengthen_roadmap
- @roadmap_setdate
- @pull_roadmap_date
- @push_roadmap_date
- @roadmaps_choices: Let's talk with someone else instead

@erc_relax_roadmap
title: Maybe we should pursue a less radical Roadmap
subtitle: This may be disappointing for some, while for others it's the realistic option.
choose-if: player_roadmap > 1 and erc_civic_strength < 30
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap <= 1: It is not possible for us to relax our Roadmap any further without alienating the party. ?] [? if erc_civic_strength >= 30: Pro-independence civic organizations tied to the party have too much strength for this to happen. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.erc_roadmap -= 1;
    Q.independence_trust -= 15;
    Q.erc_civic_dissent += 10;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_dissent -= 5;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_strength += 5;
    Q.player_roadmap_change_countdown = 9;
    Q.player_roadmap_change_trigger = false;
!}

We've changed our discursive line to be one following a [+ player_roadmap : roadmap +] roadmap. Let's now make that happen!

@erc_strengthen_roadmap
title: Let's push for a more ambitious Roadmap
subtitle: While the most pro-independence people in the party will celebrate this, some cooler-headed voters may be alienated.
choose-if: player_roadmap < 3 and erc_pragmatic_strength < 30
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap >= 3: It is not possible for us to relax our Roadmap any further without alienating the party. ?] [? if erc_pragmatic_strength >= 30: The pragmatists in the party have too much strength for this to happen. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.erc_roadmap += 1;
    Q.independence_trust += 5;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_dissent += 10;
    Q.erc_civic_dissent -= 5;
    Q.erc_civic_strength += 5;
    Q.player_roadmap_change_countdown = 9;
    Q.player_roadmap_change_trigger = false;
!}

We've changed our discursive line to be one following a [+ player_roadmap : roadmap +] roadmap. Let's now make that happen!

@roadmap_setdate
title: Let's set a deadline for our Roadmap
subtitle: This is sort of expected from us.
view-if: roadmap_year = 0

@pull_roadmap_date
title: Let's make our date goal more ambitious!
subtitle: We can choose to move our target year forward by [? if roadmap_year - year > 3: a couple of years. ?][? if roadmap_year - year <= 3: a year. ?]
view-if: roadmap_year > 0 
choose-if: roadmap_year != year
unavailable-subtitle: We have the present year already as the target!
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.roadmap_year - Q.year > 3) {
        Q.roadmap_year -= 2;
    } else {
        Q.roadmap_year -= 1;
    }
    Q.independence_trust += 5;
    Q.independence_momentum += 5;
    Q.erc_civic_strength += 3;
    Q.erc_civic_dissent -= 5;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_dissent += 3;

    // TODO: more effects here?
!}

We are now taking an new level of commitment, and we have updated our official line to promise we'll fulfill our [+ player_roadmap : roadmap +] roadmap by [+ roadmap_year +].

@push_roadmap_date
title: Let's try to relax our date goal expectations
view-if: roadmap_year > 0 
choose-if: roadmap_year < 2020 and ((player_party == "erc" and not erc_in_gob and not erc_supporting) or (player_party == "cup" and not cup_in_gob and not cup_supporting))
subtitle: We can try to quietly push our target by one year
unavailable-subtitle: [? if roadmap_year >= 2020: Our target year is already quite a late one... ?][? if (player_party == "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party == "cup" and cup_in_gob): We are governing right now, and we are expected to keep our commitments. ?][? if (player_party == "erc" and erc_supporting) or (player_party == "cup" and cup_supporting): We are supporting the current government right now, and we are expected to keep our commitments. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.roadmap_year += 1;
    Q.independence_trust -= 7;
    Q.independence_momentum -= 2;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_dissent -= 5;
    Q.erc_civic_dissent += 5;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_strength += 5;

    // TODO: more effects here?
!}

Quietly and hoping it flies under the radar, we are now talking about fulfilling our [+ player_roadmap : roadmap +] roadmap by [+ roadmap_year +] instead.


