@move_to_player
title: Try to push [+ roadmaps_target +] towards [+ player_roadmap : roadmap +]
subtitle: [? if roadmaps_target_reach < 3: This will take significant efforts. \[-1 resources \] ?] 
choose-if: player_roadmap != 0 and roadmaps_target_current_roadmap != player_roadmap and (party_resources >= 1 or roadmaps_target_reach = 3) and roadmaps_target_relations > 55
unavailable-subtitle: [? if roadmaps_target_current_roadmap = player_roadmap: Our roadmaps are already aligned! ?][? if roadmaps_target_relations <= 55: We don't have good enough relations with [+ roadmaps_target +]. ?][? if party_resources < 1 and roadmaps_target_reach < 3: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.roadmaps_target_reach != 3) {
        Q.party_resources -= 1;
    }

    if (Q.player_roadmap <  Q.roadmaps_target_current_roadmap) {
        Q.independence_trust -= 5;
    }

    if (Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] >= 1) {
        // Can we even move the target party to such a roadmap, even after lobbying?
        if (Q[Q.roadmaps_target+ "_ideology"].includes("Unilateralism")) {
            if (Q.player_roadmap < 2 || (Q.roadmaps_target == "cup" && Q.cup_faction != "Poble Lliure")) {
                Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] = 3;
            } else {
                Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] = 0;
                Q[Q.roadmaps_target + "_roadmap"] = Q.player_roadmap;
            }
        } else if (Q[Q.roadmaps_target+ "_ideology"].includes("Pragmati")) { // includes both Pragmatic Independence and Pact-Pragmatism
            if (Q.roadmaps_target_current_roadmap > 2 ) {
                Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] = 3;
            } else {
                Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] = 0;
                Q[Q.roadmaps_target + "_roadmap"] += 1;
            }
        } else if (Q[Q.roadmaps_target+ "_ideology"].includes("Independence")) {
            Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] = 0;
            if (Q.roadmaps_target_current_roadmap > Q.player_roadmap ) {
                Q[Q.roadmaps_target + "_roadmap"] -= 1;
            } else {
                Q[Q.roadmaps_target + "_roadmap"] += 1;
            }
        } else {
            Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] = 3;
        }
    } else {
        Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"] = 1;
    }

    Q[Q.roadmaps_target + "_relations"] += 2;
    Q.roadmaps_target_reach = Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.roadmaps_target + "_reach"];
    Q.roadmaps_target_current_roadmap = Q[Q.roadmaps_target + "_roadmap"];
!}

[? if roadmaps_target_reach = 3: The differences between our positions seem to be too large at the moment. It's not like they are uninterested at our talking points after this much insisting, but for them to move closer to us we may actually have to compromise a bit too.  ?]
[? if roadmaps_target_reach = 1: The representatives from [? if roadmaps_target = "pdcat" or roadmaps_target = "cup": the ?][+ roadmaps_target +] have been quite attentive listening to us and are not outright discarding our ideas, not all in the party are ready yet to embrace such positions openly. We may need to push them a bit further for this to happen. ?]
[? if roadmaps_target_reach = 0: Our outreach towards [? if roadmaps_target = "pdcat" or roadmaps_target = "cup": the ?][+ roadmaps_target +] has been successful! After some difficult deliberations, they will be openly adopting a [+ roadmaps_target_current_roadmap : roadmap  +]  ?]

[? if roadmaps_target_reach != 0  and roadmaps_target_reach != 1 and roadmaps_target_reach != 3: This seems to be a BUG and you should NOT be seeing this text. Please report it!  ?]

@erc_improve
title: Let's instead focus on improving our relations
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
view-if: player_party = "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources. 
go-to: erc_inter_party.ciu_relations if roadmaps_target = "ciu"; erc_inter_party.pdcat_nosplit_relations if roadmaps_target = "pdcat" and not pdcat_split; erc_inter_party.cdc_relations if roadmaps_target = "cdc";erc_inter_party.dl_relations if roadmaps_target = "dl"; erc_inter_party.jxcat_noerc_relations if roadmaps_target = "jxcat"; erc_inter_party.junts_relations if roadmaps_target = "junts"; erc_inter_party.cup_relations if roadmaps_target = "cup"; erc_inter_party.fnc_relations if roadmaps_target = "fnc"; erc_inter_party.pdcat_split_relations if roadmaps_target = "pdcat" and pdcat_split

@cup_improve
title: Let's instead focus on improving our relations
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
view-if: player_party = "cup"
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources. 
