@move_erc
title: Discuss the Roadmap with ERC
view-if: erc_parlament_s > 0 and player_party != "erc"
on-arrival: roadmaps_target = "erc"; roadmaps_target_current_roadmap = erc_roadmap; roadmaps_target_relations = erc_relations; roadmaps_target_reach = roadmaps_card_erc_reach;

ERC is currently defending a [+ erc_roadmap: roadmap +] roadmap.

- @move_to_player
- @cup_improve
- @roadmaps_choices: Let's talk with someone else instead

@move_ciu
title: Discuss the Roadmap with CiU
view-if: player_party != "ciu" and ciu_parlament_s > 0
on-arrival: roadmaps_target = "ciu"

CiU is playing a difficult balancing act. While CDC is moving towards openly calling for independence, UDC not so much. Pushing beyond a demand for a referendum may strain the formation.

- @move_ciu_to_player
- @erc_improve
- @cup_improve
- @roadmaps_choices: Let's talk with someone else instead

@move_ciu_to_player
title: Try to push CiU towards [+ player_roadmap : roadmap +]
subtitle: This will take significant efforts. \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: player_roadmap != 0 and ciu_roadmap != player_roadmap and party_resources >= 1 and ciu_relations > 55 and congreso_decidir_trigger and parlament_sovereignty_declaration
unavailable-subtitle: [? if ciu_roadmap = player_roadmap: Our roadmaps are already aligned! ?][? if ciu_roadmap = player_roadmap and not congreso_decidir_trigger and not parlament_sovereignty_declaration: CiU is adamant that we at least give the referendum-on-agreement path a try first. ?][? if ciu_relations <= 55: We don't have good enough relations with CiU. ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_resources -= 1;
    if (Q.roadmaps_card_ciu_reach >= 1 && Q.ciu_roadmap == 1) {
        Q.ciu_roadmap = 2;
        Q.roadmaps_card_ciu_reach += 1;
    } else {
        Q.roadmaps_card_ciu_reach = 1;
    }
    Q.ciu_relations += 2;
!}

[? if roadmaps_card_ciu_reach = 1: While [+ ciu_leader +] and some around [? if ciu_leader_gender = "m": him ?][? if ciu_leader_gender = "f": her ?] may now be a bit more favorable towards open and strategic confrontation with the state, not all in the party are ready yet to embrace such positions openly. We may need to push them a bit further for this to happen. ?]
[? if roadmaps_card_ciu_reach = 2: It seems like our insistence is paying off, and CiU will be embracing a roadmap of [+ ciu_roadmap : roadmap +]. ?]
[? if roadmaps_card_ciu_reach > 2: CiU has already been pushed by us toward a [+ ciu_roadmap : roadmap +] roadmap. [? if player_roadmap = 3: It is quite unlikely that they will embrace any more radical position as long as UDC is still part of the club. ?][? if player_roadmap <= 1: It is unlikely that they will revert this quite radical change in their strategy so soon after adopting it. ?]?]

@move_cdc
title: Discuss the Roadmap with [+ parlament_current_ciu +]
view-if: player_party != parlament_current_ciu and (parlament_current_ciu = "cdc" or parlament_current_ciu = "dl" or parlament_current_ciu = "pdcat" or parlament_current_ciu = "junts")
on-arrival: {!
    Q.roadmaps_target = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.roadmaps_target_current_roadmap = Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_roadmap"]; 
    Q.roadmaps_target_relations = Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"]; 
    Q.roadmaps_target_reach = Q["roadmaps_card_" + Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_reach"];
!}

[+ parlament_current_ciu +] is currently defending a [+ roadmaps_target_current_roadmap: roadmap +] roadmap.

- @move_to_player
- @erc_improve
- @cup_improve
- @roadmaps_choices: Let's talk with someone else instead

